WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.934
Here is the question.

2
00:00:01.388 --> 00:00:03.766
Explain three safe ways to store chemicals.

3
00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:06.312
Let's learn the answer.

4
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.910
There are three safe ways.

5
00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:09.985
Way one.

6
00:00:10.432 --> 00:00:12.975
Check the Safety Data Sheet for storage requirements.

7
00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:15.083
Way two.

8
00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:17.473
Keep the chemical in its original container.

9
00:00:19.025 --> 00:00:19.655
Way three.

10
00:00:20.096 --> 00:00:22.445
Label the container with hazard warning signs.

11
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:24.450
Remember.

12
00:00:24.796 --> 00:00:29.435
Read the Safety Data Sheet, keep the original container, label with hazard signs.

13
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:30.837
Well done Caleb!
